ions of an agent performing its tasks belong to AI Agents, not the business/pricing angle", "Jokes/personal reactions without concrete business facts belong to AI Culture and Commentary"], "include": ["Competitive market-position claims about AI labs (e.g., 'only company left')", "Token/subscription pricing comparisons between AI products", "Marketing or promotional campaigns tying an AI product to a new user segment", "Startup launch announcements citing funding batch and financial/trading results", "Small-business monetization stories built around reselling AI capability to clients"], "path": ["AI and ML", "AI Industry and Business"], "sibling_cues": [{"confusing_alternative": "Frontier Models (technical capability comparison)", "evidence_needed": "Quote must be about company standing/market dominance, not model benchmarks", "include_cue": "Competitive market-position claims about AI labs"}, {"confusing_alternative": "AI Culture and Commentary (joke about a product)", "evidence_needed": "Quote must reference concrete pricing/cost figures rather than function as a punchline", "include_cue": "Token/subscription pricing comparisons"}, {"confusing_alternative": "AI and ML (general product feature news)", "evidence_needed": "Quote must describe a business/marketing campaign strategy, not just a feature description", "include_cue": "Marketing/promotional campaigns tying AI to a new segment"}, {"confusing_alternative": "Frontier Models (foundation model release)", "evidence_needed": "Quote must include business framing (funding batch, returns, market claim) alongside any model mention", "include_cue": "Startup launch announcements citing funding/financial results"}, {"confusing_alternative": "AI Agents (agent doing the work)", "evidence_needed": "Quote must center on the business/sales/pricing side of the offer, not the agent's task execution", "include_cue": "Small-business monetization stories reselling AI capability"}], "supporting_evidence": [{"card_hash": "e8dfe394c660a7d3e4d8a3cac26511b8882c593ed3597eed713ac23fa528abe4", "excerpt_id": "8bfe2833b433993df1d47592cae20945e09af2d806a510b79fb0efbcd1ca20da", "quote": "We're Prodigy, an AI trading research lab. We've built the world's best foundation model for quantitative finance.", "source_revision": "d526a6f940a9520931b7ca94b19c26fe8592a8e3b99330999c8933984d85ee17", "video_id": "2086894292539424768"}, {"card_hash": "d72bafd393b9ce26fffe55a0b61b553ffbc2d1887500f7af5c4c3fc269662a3a", "excerpt_id": "5469768002006cd50eb5368433a55cf49f70444d301d9ade5c05ccf4f9a4888f", "quote": "Why would anyone pay $6 / 1M tokens", "source_revision": "69957a77704fc683a9b799e52d222cb35f0a499bb58f1a6055042ff08ec227b2", "video_id": "2087194180972118016"}, {"card_hash": "88a1415750f852157f465e92a6b79ca179ff71157410ca694b8c7f8e49aa0e84", "excerpt_id": "40733883db645b6b2004573ce38c488244c65f8c220ba8e635c0a5347c70be7d", "quote": "College students in the US will be able to claim a year of ChatGPT Plus for free.", "source_revision": "4f4225636c1f10aa43572630a9df38303c38fa53523df8201121b18450bcf75a", "video_id": "2087297832189403136"}, {"card_hash": "34eab37f83fdcfd8d75bd671e89a1acb1c891e9375e55f61c1af6937b026555c", "excerpt_id": "4393c2eb26dcd2fd8a6a26441354507a11a1121ebae2465f614d0e394e34a6d4", "quote": "Welcome in to an AI agency inner circle member interview.", "source_revision": "df514ef77e29ab5dfd2ee5342063268a10380b9bd882c34e5689dcb7835483ca", "video_id": "2087489577129013248"}, {"card_hash": "859b6f071b438fde0bca619874022b69e4ff61e5a4223ba6292c2aa0c311448b", "excerpt_id": "f21e23ee1fd620201528fa15b54aca18d2b96858511b27ec85fa845a4b27cb34", "quote": "Anthropic Believes They Could Be the ONLY Company Left in the World", "source_revision": "933e8046a21ff31aac591fb15efd8030c84890989b96dece21548adcdfcb83a7", "video_id": "2088366674667773952"}, {"card_hash": "642eeea2d461b78b010fbc9cb927bd8e575f0f3c3ad6fd983a586ca4587c2cfe", "excerpt_id": "5613a03bfa71dbdb59594068c047459356a3d4e276c0749a2b34dc552768fcf5", "quote": "Anthropic might be the only private company in the world at some point.", "source_revision": "6fa6649d36d758ed5d1931b99ef37df435ee167c0ac78226844d2eb706363940", "video_id": "2088372080949739520"}]}, {"definition": "Covers short-form social reactions, memes, jokes, and personal opinions about AI's everyday use and cultural impact, without technical benchmarking or business analysis.", "exclude": ["Company strategy, pricing rationale, or funding details belong to AI Industry and Business", "Instructional or demo content teaching a coding tool belongs to Developer Tools", "Benchmark or architecture discussion belongs to Frontier Models"], "include": ["Memes about AI replacing jobs or people", "Jokes about hitting usage limits on AI coding tools", "Viral entertainment stories framed as a comparison to AI quality", "Offhand stat comparisons posted for humor or shock value", "Personal one-line reactions to canceling or dropping an AI subscription", "Broad opinion posts on AI's effect on internet content quality"], "path": ["AI and ML", "AI Culture and Commentary"], "sibling_cues": [{"confusing_alternative": "AI Agents (agent doing real work)", "evidence_needed": "Quote must be a joke/self-deprecating quip, not a description of an agent's actual task list", "include_cue": "Memes about AI replacing jobs/people"}, {"confusing_alternative": "Developer Tools (coding assistant tutorial)", "evidence_needed": "Quote must be humor about running out of quota, not instructional tool-usage content", "include_cue": "Jokes about hitting usage limits on AI coding tools"}, {"confusing_alternative": "Frontier Models (capability evaluation)", "evidence_needed": "Quote must be cultural/entertainment commentary (box office, viewer reaction), not a model benchmark", "include_cue": "Viral entertainment stories compared to AI quality"}, {"confusing_alternative": "AI Industry and Business (business metric)", "evidence_needed": "Quote must pair unrelated numbers for comedic effect, not report